{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"拉-推"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"观念"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"拉-推"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><strong>拉-推</strong> (pull-push), 又叫<strong>积分变换</strong>, 是一类通过"},{"Local":{"url":"关系2-范畴","text":"关系"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{ccccc}\r\n &amp;&amp; Z &amp;&amp; \\\\\r\n&amp; \\swarrow &amp; &amp; \\searrow &amp; \\\\\r\nX &amp;&amp;&amp;&amp; Y\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n与某种双向的函子性 (如"},{"Local":{"url":"六函子","text":"六函子"}},{"Plain":"), 将 $X$ 上的对象 (函数或层) 变为 $Y$ 上的对象操作. 通常的做法是先 “拉” 到 $Z$, 乘以 $Z$ 上的特定对象 (“系数”), 再 “推” 到 $Y$.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>矩阵乘法</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"Fourier变换","text":null}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"Fourier–Sato变换","text":null}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"Fourier--向井变换","text":null}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}